  "comments": [
    {
      "position": 0,
      "source_id": null,
      "text": "動詞可能形　＋　〜ものなら：　〜ことが可能なら　（実現が難しいことについて言うことが多い）\n \"If only I could/may...,\" \n\n〜う／ようものなら： もし〜ようなことをしたら．．．（大変なことになる） Once if (one) happen to ... , then (bad consequence).\"",
      "html": "動詞可能形　＋　〜ものなら：　〜ことが可能なら　（実現が難しいことについて言うことが多い）<br/> \"If only I could/may...,\" <br/><br/>〜う／ようものなら： もし〜ようなことをしたら．．．（大変なことになる） Once if (one) happen to ... , then (bad consequence).\"",
      "credits_raw": "誠",
      "content_sha256": "8b1d61084db9d5cb1fb248bee0137b04d0e24c0aba077f493fcbf70e8be7a532",
      "original_created_at": null,
      "original_updated_at": null
    },
    {
      "position": 1,
      "source_id": null,
      "text": "Used when one wishes to do something difficult.\nUsually used together with the potential form.",
      "html": "Used when one wishes to do something difficult.<br/>Usually used together with the potential form.",
      "credits_raw": "halx",
      "content_sha256": "12c0307e03cefed2f8fc7fa54304cdb674de77b5ec29c6a67810d37ed547271a",
      "original_created_at": null,
      "original_updated_at": null
    },
    {
      "position": 2,
      "source_id": null,
      "text": "\"if\" does not quite get you there. For example, \"If I come home late, he won't let me in\" should perhaps be \"Would I come home late, he won't let me in the house.\"\nものなら is not iffy.",
      "html": "\"if\" does not quite get you there. For example, \"If I come home late, he won't let me in\" should perhaps be \"Would I come home late, he won't let me in the house.\"<br/>ものなら is not iffy.",
      "credits_raw": "bamboo4",
      "content_sha256": "2ead92c4dd7b7dad4e00907271d365fea5853eb847911e1b1ad8d7f438a501d1",
      "original_created_at": null,
      "original_updated_at": null
    },
    {
      "position": 3,
      "source_id": null,
      "text": "ex #3724 has nothing to do with this grammar point.\n甘いもの (= sweets) just happens to be suffixed with なら (group 3)",
      "html": "ex #3724 has nothing to do with this grammar point.<br/>甘いもの (= sweets) just happens to be suffixed with なら (group 3)",
      "credits_raw": "halx",
      "content_sha256": "2c5cf433ac854439f9f97f4e4acf722841d45fd1f9d2c5e1e27946d58c31bf16",
      "original_created_at": null,
      "original_updated_at": null
    },
    {
      "position": 4,
      "source_id": null,
      "text": "Shouldn't ex #3722 be better translated as: \"Whatever you pick for me is fine\"?",
      "html": "Shouldn't ex #3722 be better translated as: \"Whatever you pick for me is fine\"?",
      "credits_raw": "halx",
      "content_sha256": "d16434c41e0cea3f8b4131c968a7532ce5b1b2bfed9011513c4518b12cc47621",
      "original_created_at": null,
      "original_updated_at": null
    },
    {
      "position": 5,
      "source_id": null,
      "text": "-ようものなら is quite iffy. it denotes a hypothetical condition. [if i came home late, he wouldn't let me in]",
      "html": "-ようものなら is quite iffy. it denotes a hypothetical condition. [if i came home late, he wouldn't let me in]",
      "credits_raw": "mk",
      "content_sha256": "c431cbc6e775d58ebaf6f39c23952ae05c7f058b20160737f8d9420e1822169f",
      "original_created_at": null,
      "original_updated_at": null
    },
    {
      "position": 6,
      "source_id": null,
      "text": "ex #3719 is 〜もの(thing)　＋　ならば, and therefore does not belong to the usage of 〜ものなら .\nFrom ex#3719 to ex#3724, it doesn't give the meaning or correct usage of 〜ものなら, therefore treat it as 〜もの　＋　なら。 \n〜ものなら always follow the 可能形 potential form. and used to indicate something difficult to realize, or some ideal thinking of the writer,e.g. : \"If only i was still a child, ....\"",
      "html": "ex #3719 is 〜もの(thing)　＋　ならば, and therefore does not belong to the usage of 〜ものなら .<br/>From ex#3719 to ex#3724, it doesn't give the meaning or correct usage of 〜ものなら, therefore treat it as 〜もの　＋　なら。 <br/>〜ものなら always follow the 可能形 potential form. and used to indicate something difficult to realize, or some ideal thinking of the writer,e.g. : \"If only i was still a child, ....\"",
      "credits_raw": "誠",
      "content_sha256": "ec7f114087610f8215c33e76bd685b3d58b5f68051874e32aad90db0e41e323c",
      "original_created_at": null,
      "original_updated_at": null
    },
    {
      "position": 7,
      "source_id": null,
      "text": "ex #3228 belongs to 〜う／ようものなら:\nMy father is very strict. Once if I happen to come home late, my dad won't let me in.",
      "html": "ex #3228 belongs to 〜う／ようものなら:<br/>My father is very strict. Once if I happen to come home late, my dad won't let me in.",
